  "name": "Color of Observation Adept",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/magic/perception/third-eye-blue-red.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your training in Observation Haki has allowed you to see far beyond the capabilities of standard human eyes, allowing you to control your senses like the lens of a camera.</p>\n<p><strong>Sense Shape.</strong> The permanent bonus to your AC and Saving Throws increases to +3. In addition, you can now shape Sense Presence as a line that is 120 feet long and 10 feet wide that extends from you, rather than a radius around you. On each of your turns, you can extend the length of the line by 120 feet, to a maximum of a mile.</p>",
